config BR2_PACKAGE_VOL
	bool "vol"
	help
	  The machine's volume knob. ALSA brings the SB16 up with every
	  control at zero -- on real hardware alsactl restores levels at
	  boot, but this image ships no alsa-utils, so the card stays
	  muted and /dev/dsp plays silence. vol(1) sets master and PCM
	  through the OSS mixer (/dev/mixer, CONFIG_SND_MIXER_OSS) and
	  its S25vol init script turns the knob to 100 at boot.
